{"id": "eec210e1-c9ce-4039-af84-cdd912936339", "slug": "ship-faster-sync-github-workspace", "title": "Ship Faster - Sync GitHub & Workspace", "description": "Ship Faster Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Ship Faster - Sync GitHub & Workspace\"\ndescription: \"Ship Faster Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F97316\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#3B82F6\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"32px\"\n  control: \"31px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Ship Faster - Sync GitHub & Workspace\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 273; favorites: 15; remixes: 3.\nTags: dashboard, animated, threejs, bento, action, effect, charts.\n## Overview\nShip Faster Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nFrom repo to launch. Ship faster. Keep issues, pull requests, implementation tasks, and launch updates perfectly synced between your studio workspace and GitHub, without slowing delivery. 68% SYNC View Filter In Sync 6…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: From repo to launch. Ship faster.; Two-way synchronization; Private tasks; Multiple repositories; Milestone migration; Track progress.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F97316, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #3B82F6, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Ship Faster - Sync GitHub & Workspace</title>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-white font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-blue-500/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n  <section class=\"relative pt-32 pb-40 overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n    <!-- Background Ambient Glows -->\n    <div class=\"glow-breathe absolute top-[20%] left-[10%] w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full blur-[140px] opacity-40 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(56,189,248,0.3) 0%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"glow-breathe-delay absolute top-[40%] right-[5%] w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full blur-[150px] opacity-30 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(249,115,22,0.25) 0%, transparent 70%);\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"max-w-[80rem] mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 w-full\">\n\n      <!-- Hero Text with GSAP Masked Reveal -->\n      <h2 class=\"text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-normal tracking-tighter leading-none mb-8 max-w-3xl\" id=\"reveal-title\">\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">From</span></span>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">repo</span></span>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">to</span></span>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">launch.</span></span>\n        <br>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2 pt-2\"><span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%]\">Ship</span></span>\n        <span class=\"inline-flex overflow-hidden pb-2 pt-2\">\n          <span class=\"reveal-word inline-block translate-y-[110%] text-transparent bg-clip-text\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #60a5fa, #f97316); -webkit-background-clip: text;\">faster.</span>\n        </span>\n      </h2>\n\n      <p id=\"reveal-desc\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-400 mb-24 max-w-2xl font-extralight leading-relaxed opacity-0 translate-y-4\">\n        Keep issues, pull requests, implementation tasks, and launch updates\n        perfectly synced between your studio workspace and GitHub, without\n        slowing delivery.\n      </p>\n\n      <!-- Dashboard Visual Container -->\n      <div class=\"dashboard-container relative max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-40 shadow-[0_40px_100px_-20px_rgba(0,0,0,1)]\">\n\n        <!-- Subtle outer glow behind dashboard -->\n        <div class=\"absolute -inset-8 blur-3xl opacity-50 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(59,130,246,0.2) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(249,115,22,0.15) 0%, transparent 50%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Premium Border Gradient Shell -->\n        <div class=\"relative p-[1px] rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden bg-white/5\">\n\n          <!-- Rotating Conic Gradient Beam -->\n          <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 w-[200%] h-[200%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 animate-[spin_8s_linear_infinite] opacity-80\"\n               style=\"background: conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0deg, transparent 40deg, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8) 80deg, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.4) 100deg, transparent 130deg, transparent 220deg, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.8) 260deg, rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.4) 280deg, transparent 310deg, transparent 360deg);\">\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Inner Dashboard Surface -->\n          <div class=\"relative z-10 bg-[#090a0d] rounded-[31px] overflow-hidden flex flex-col min-h-[500px] border border-white/5 shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.02)]\">\n\n            <!-- Dashboard Content Flex -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-1\">\n\n              <!-- Sidebar -->\n              <aside class=\"hidden sm:flex flex-col w-20 border-r border-white/5 bg-[#050608] py-6 items-center gap-6 relative z-20\">\n                <!-- Logo -->\n                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\">\n                  <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:box-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-white text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Sync Progress Indicator -->\n                <div class=\"w-12 rounded-2xl bg-black border border-blue-500/20 shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] p-2 pb-3 text-center mt-2 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                  <div class=\"text-xs font-normal text-blue-100\">68%</div>\n                  <div class=\"w-full h-[1px] bg-blue-500/30 my-2\"></div>\n                  <div class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-blue-400/80 tracking-widest\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl; text-orientation: mixed; transform: rotate(180deg);\">SYNC</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Nav Icons -->\n                <nav class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 mt-4 text-neutral-500\">\n                  <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white transition-all\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:home-2-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white transition-all\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:folder-with-files-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-white/10 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] border border-white/5\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:branching-paths-up-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white transition-all\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bell-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white transition-all mt-auto\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:settings-linear\" class=\"text-xl\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                  </button>\n                </nav>\n              </aside>\n\n              <!-- Main Content Area -->\n              <div class=\"flex-1 p-4 sm:p-6 bg-[#0a0b0f] relative z-20 flex flex-col min-w-0\">\n\n                <!-- Topbar -->\n                <header class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-6\">\n                  <div class=\"flex-1 h-10 sm:h-11 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5 flex items-center px-4 text-neutral-500 transition-colors focus-within:border-white/20 focus-within:bg-white/[0.05]\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnifer-linear\" class=\"text-lg mr-3 shrink-0\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search issues, pull requests, or branches...\" class=\"bg-transparent border-none outline-none w-full text-sm text-neutral-300 placeholder-neutral-600 truncate\">\n                  </div>\n                  <button class=\"hidden sm:flex h-11 px-4 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5 text-sm font-normal text-neutral-300 items-center gap-2 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:eye-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon> View\n                  </button>\n                  <button class=\"hidden sm:flex h-11 px-4 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/5 text-sm font-normal text-neutral-300 items-center gap-2 hover:bg-white/[0.06] transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:filter-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon> Filter\n                  </button>\n                </header>\n\n                <!-- Data Table: In Sync -->\n                <div class=\"rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-[#0f1116] overflow-x-auto shadow-sm\">\n                  <div class=\"px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3 min-w-[700px] bg-white/[0.01]\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(59,130,246,0.8)]\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-wide font-medium text-white uppercase\">In Sync</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600 font-medium ml-1\">6</span>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"divide-y divide-white/5 min-w-[700px] github-row-container\">\n\n                    <!-- Row 1 -->\n                    <div class=\"github-row grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-mono\">GH-102</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Sync pull request status with workspace tasks</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-blue-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 text-blue-300 text-xs font-normal\">MVP</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-orange-500/30 border-t-orange-500 animate-spin\"></div> 18 hrs\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">12 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-400 to-red-500 text-white text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">AR</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 2 -->\n                    <div class=\"github-row grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-mono\">GH-118</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Map GitHub labels into product workflow stages</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-300 text-xs font-normal\">PreMVP</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-orange-500/30 border-t-orange-500 animate-spin\"></div> 14 hrs\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">13 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-400 to-indigo-500 text-white text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">MK</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 3 -->\n                    <div class=\"github-row grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-mono\">GH-126</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Create automatic issue grouping by repository</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-normal\">Automate</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-orange-500/30 border-t-orange-500 animate-spin\"></div> 22 hrs\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">14 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400 to-teal-500 text-white text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">LS</div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Row 4 -->\n                    <div class=\"github-row grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5 hover:bg-white/[0.02] transition-colors\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs font-mono\">GH-131</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-200 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Display linked commits inside task activity</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/20 text-rose-300 text-xs font-normal\">Review</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full border-2 border-orange-500/30 border-t-orange-500 animate-spin\"></div> 8 hrs\n                      </div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-xs\">15 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-400 to-rose-500 text-white text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">BC</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Data Table: Dimmed Section -->\n                <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.03] bg-[#0a0b0e] overflow-x-auto opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300\">\n                  <div class=\"px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/[0.03] flex items-center gap-3 min-w-[700px]\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500\"></span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs tracking-wide font-medium text-neutral-400 uppercase\">Under Review</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neutral-600 font-medium ml-1\">2</span>\n                  </div>\n\n                  <div class=\"divide-y divide-white/[0.03] min-w-[700px]\">\n                    <!-- Row 5 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-600 text-xs font-mono\">GH-201</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Update repository permission logic</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-normal\">Security</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\">10 hrs</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-600 text-xs\">19 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center border border-white/5\">CP</div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Row 6 -->\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[80px_1fr_100px_100px_90px_40px] items-center gap-4 px-5 py-3.5\">\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-600 text-xs font-mono\">GH-219</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-normal truncate\">Improve commit timeline grouping</div>\n                      <div><span class=\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-white/5 border border-white/5 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-normal\">UI/UX</span></div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-500 text-sm\">16 hrs</div>\n                      <div class=\"text-neutral-600 text-xs\">20 May</div>\n                      <div class=\"w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-medium flex items-center justify-center border border-white/5\">SV</div>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Fade bottom to simulate infinite scroll/crop -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-32 z-30 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to top, #090a0d 10%, transparent 100%);\"></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Feature Grid -->\n      <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-16 feature-grid relative z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Feature 1 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:refresh-circle-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Two-way<br>synchronization</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Connect GitHub issues and workspace tasks so every update stays synced in both directions seamlessly.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Feature 2 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:lock-keyhole-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Private<br>tasks</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Keep internal planning separate while still linking the right GitHub activity to your immediate team.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Feature 3 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-minimalistic-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Multiple<br>repositories</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Organize work across multiple repositories without losing visibility across your broader projects.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Feature 4 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:flag-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Milestone<br>migration</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Move milestones and project structure smoothly between your workspace and external GitHub tracking.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Feature 5 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Track<br>progress</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Monitor commits, pull requests, issue progress, and team delivery velocity from one clean view.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Feature 6 -->\n        <div class=\"feature-card opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n          <div class=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl p-[1px] mb-6 inline-block\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\">\n            <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[#0a0a0a] rounded-[15px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner\">\n              <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:filter-linear\" class=\"text-2xl text-white\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"text-xl font-normal mb-3 text-white tracking-tight\">Advanced<br>filtering</h3>\n          <p class=\"text-neutral-400 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed\">Filter issues, pull requests, labels, repositories, and individual owners with precise controls.</p>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <script>\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n      gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n      // Hero Title Masked Reveal\n      gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n        y: \"0%\",\n        duration: 1.2,\n        stagger: 0.08,\n        ease: \"power4.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \"#reveal-title\",\n          start: \"top 85%\",\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Hero Description Fade In\n      gsap.to(\"#reveal-desc\", {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 1,\n        delay: 0.4,\n        ease: \"power3.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \"#reveal-title\",\n          start: \"top 85%\",\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Dashboard Hover/Float Effect\n      gsap.to(\".dashboard-container\", {\n        y: -12,\n        duration: 4,\n        yoyo: true,\n        repeat: -1,\n        ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n      });\n\n      // Dashboard Rows Staggered Reveal\n      gsap.from(\".github-row\", {\n        opacity: 0,\n        x: -20,\n        duration: 0.8,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \".github-row-container\",\n          start: \"top 85%\",\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Feature Grid Reveal\n      gsap.to(\".feature-card\", {\n        opacity: 1,\n        y: 0,\n        duration: 0.8,\n        stagger: 0.1,\n        ease: \"power3.out\",\n        scrollTrigger: {\n          trigger: \".feature-grid\",\n          start: \"top 80%\",\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Background Glow Breathing (Alternative to keyframes)\n      gsap.to(\".glow-breathe\", {\n        scale: 1.1,\n        opacity: 0.5,\n        duration: 5,\n        yoyo: true,\n        repeat: -1,\n        ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n      });\n      gsap.to(\".glow-breathe-delay\", {\n        scale: 1.15,\n        opacity: 0.4,\n        duration: 6,\n        delay: 2,\n        yoyo: true,\n        repeat: -1,\n        ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ship-faster-sync-github-workspace.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/ship-faster-sync-github-workspace.jpg", "source_name": "ship-faster-sync-github-workspace-DESIGN.md", "views": 341, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:53:34.564725+00:00"}